    "chunk_text": "gecende. Se deofol hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, s\u00e6cg me, Margareta, hwanon is \u00fein lif & \u00fein lichama, & hwanon is \u00fein sawul Se halga f\u00e6mne him answarode & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Nys me alifed \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fee to secg\u00e6, for\u00feon \u00feu ne eart ne Godes bebodu ic wille gehyran & \u00fe\u00e6t gecy\u00fean, & \u00feu, deofol, adumbe nu, for\u00feon \u00fee ic nelle nan word & hr\u00e6dlice se eor\u00fee forswalg \u00feone w\u00e6lhreowan deofol grimlice. \u00d0a, on o\u00feran d\u00e6ge, het se gerefa \u00fea halgan f\u00e6mnan to him gel\u00e6dan. & mid \u00fey \u00fee heo w\u00e6s ut agangende, heo gebletsode eall hira lichoma mid Cristes rode tacene. Se gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, eala, Margareta, gel\u00e6f on me & gebid \u00fee to minum gode. Se halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, so\u00felice, \u00fee gedafena\u00fe on mine god to gebiddanne. Se gerefa wear\u00fe \u00fea swy\u00fee yrre & het hi up ahon & mid kandelum byrnan. & hio dydan \u00fea nyxtan swa heom beboden w\u00e6s. Se halga Margareta \u00fea cigde & cw\u00e6\u00fe, nelle ic n\u00e6fre me gebiddan on eowerne god, se \u00fee is dumb & Ne magon ge oferswy\u00fean cl\u00e6ne f\u00e6mnan. Crist sylf ge gebletsode minne lichaman & minre sawule he sylle\u00fe wuldres beh. Se arleasa gerefa het \u00feider bringan mycel leaden f\u00e6t & het hit mid w\u00e6tere afyllan & dyde hit \u00e6lan \u00d0a cwylras dyden \u00fea swa heom beboden w",
